# ===== HISTOIRE 16 — VAPORWAVE (internet, ~2011) =====
# Du 80s RALENTI, étiré, noyé de chorus, nostalgique jusqu'au malaise.
# Le wow & flutter (| wow) et les accords maj7 font tout.
title:  Vapor
bpm:    68
key:    f major
scene:  superf
song:   a*8
keys:  Fmaj7 . . . Dm9 . . . Bbmaj7 . . . C . . . | wt warm | wow 0.4 | chorus 0.5 | lp 2000 | env 0.05 0.3 0.7 0.6 | reverb 0.6 | gain 0.12
bass:  1 . . . 6, . . . 4, . . . 5, . . . | sine | oct 2 | wow 0.3 | gain 0.18
lead:  1' . . 7 . 5 . . 3 . 5 . 6 . . . | sine | fm 1 1.5 | wow 0.35 | reverb 0.6 | delay 0.4 | gain 0.1
kick:  x . . . . . . . x . . . . . . . | sample bd | gain 0.35
hat:   . . x . . . x . . . x . . . x . | sample hh | gain 0.08
